{"title": "GI EGO1GS", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Two 30-second recordings of an AprilGrid, solved with MVIS for camera, IMU and time offsets.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Global shutter</span><span class=chip>Stereo</span><span class=chip>470 Hz IMU</span><span class=chip>CC BY-NC 4.0</span></div><div class=vtabs role=group aria-label=\"Choose a run\"><button type=button data-vt=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Recording 1</button><button type=button data-vt=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Recording 2</button></div>", "glance": "<div class=vtabs role=group aria-label=\"Choose a run\"><button type=button data-vt=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Recording 1</button><button type=button data-vt=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Recording 2</button></div><p>Two 30-second recordings of an AprilGrid, solved with MVIS for camera, IMU and time offsets.</p><div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/sensors/gi-ego1gs/demo.mp4\" poster=\"/media/sensors/gi-ego1gs/demo.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>The 3D scene MVIS recovered from recording 2. Everything except the board is blurred.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.13<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>62.1<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−0.44<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>31.8<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div><div class=v data-v=\"1\" hidden><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.12<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>62.2<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−1.16<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>31.5<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>No independent reference. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</p>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div><div class=v data-v=\"1\" hidden><div class=procplot id=\"proc1\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc1\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div>", "map": "<p>Solved positions and orientations, to scale in the IMU frame. Drag sideways to orbit. Tap a sensor for its values.</p><div class=map><div class=stage><canvas id=rig tabindex=0 aria-label=\"3D map of the cameras and IMU\"></canvas><div class=tools><button data-view=iso type=button>3D</button><button data-view=front type=button>Front</button><button data-view=top type=button>Top</button><button data-view=side type=button>Side</button><button data-z=1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button><button data-z=-1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button></div></div><div class=panel><div class=picks id=picks></div><div id=info></div></div></div>", "hardware": "<div class=scroll><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Shutter</td><td>Global</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>2 × 1080p at 30 fps</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>Field of view</td><td>157° × 84°</td><t