a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Baseline</dt><dd>63 mm<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>IMU</dt><dd>9-DoF, 400 Hz<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Output</dt><dd>One .mcap file, H.265<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div></dl><p class=sd-foot>Maker values checked 2026-11-03 · 2 recordings, 30.1 s each · CC BY-NC 4.0</p></div></div></div>", "specifications": "<div class=scroll><table class=spec-table><tbody><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>Published by the maker</th></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Stereo, dual microphones <a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\" aria-label=\"Source\">↗︎</a></td></tr><tr><td>Synchronization</td><td>All four streams on one hardware clock <a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\" aria-label=\"Source\">↗︎</a></td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>MicroSD, 128 GB card included <a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\" aria-label=\"Source\">↗︎</a></td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wi-Fi and USB <a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\" aria-label=\"Source\">↗︎</a></td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>USB power bank; 12 to 16 hours on 10,000 mAh <a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/blog/ego1gs-vs-project-aria-vs-ego-oscar\" aria-label=\"Source\">↗︎</a></td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>About 200 g, headset only <a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\" aria-label=\"Source\">↗︎</a></td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>Measured in this recording</th></tr><tr><td>IMU rate</td><td>470.9 Hz</td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>Maker</th></tr><tr><td>Company</td><td><a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/\">General Intelligence Labs, San Francisco</a></td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>Not published</th></tr><tr><td>Parts</td><td>Sensor part numbers, lens mo